Progress Record read module: app side (DRAFT, nothing applied, nothing committed).

Pairs with T-progress-record-0138_learn_progress_record.sql. Read this preamble, then
the diff; `git apply` ignores everything above the first "diff --git" line.

BASES
  * Every file except src/lib/admin/data.ts is a diff against the current
    transplant-alchemy tree (HEAD 1e7ad5e, T77 already in), so it applies there with
    `git apply`.
  * src/lib/admin/data.ts is a diff against the file T84 creates (the new-file hunk in
    T84-admin-portal.diff, index a9941a1). It applies only once T84 is applied, and T84
    does not apply to the current tree on its own (it expects Save7Lockup.tsx and
    icons.tsx from earlier drafts), so the last hunk is checked here against the
    extracted T84 file, not against a built tree.
  * T96 and T98 also edit src/lib/admin/data.ts (a comment, then the import block and
    loadRules). The comment hunk is untouched here; the import block conflicts with this
    one by hand (the SITTING_COLUMNS line is gone, the loadActorNames line stays).
  * T99 changes the same region of getPathwayForUser in src/lib/course.ts (resume at
    the first unpassed Stage). That rule is now the record's `resume_stage_slug`, so
    this diff supersedes T99's course.ts hunk; its module page hunk is unaffected.
  * T89 changes getStageQuizStates' caller (module page). Its signature is kept so that
    hunk still applies.

WHAT CHANGES
  + src/lib/progress-record.ts: types, mapper and reads (getProgressRecord,
    getProgressRecords). Sitting, mapSitting and percent move here from baseline.ts,
    which re-exports them, so nothing that imports them from "@/lib/baseline" moves.
  ~ course.ts: getPathwayForUser lays the record over the structure; each module now
    carries `progress` (its Stage entry). getLearnerCertificates reads the record.
    getModuleStatuses is deleted. `modulesComplete` is renamed `stagesRead`.
  ~ quiz.ts: getStageQuizStates reads the record (same signature and shape).
    gradeSelection is deleted.
  ~ baseline.ts: getBaselineState reads the record; dueSitting, SITTING_COLUMNS and
    the table reads are gone (the Sitting owed is `baseline.sitting_due`).
  ~ progress.ts: isLevelContentComplete is deleted.
  ~ levels/[level]/page.tsx: no per-Stage reads; the Level is complete when the record
    says so.
  ~ dashboard/page.tsx: the "Modules complete" figures counted Read Marks, which the
    glossary forbids calling complete. They now say Stage Quizzes passed, and the
    per-Level line says "modules read". VISIBLE COPY CHANGE: check it.
  ~ admin/data.ts (on top of T84): mapLearner reshapes a record into model.ts's
    StudentRecord. No embed of eight tables, no POST filter, no attempt_no sort. The
    Eligibility Signal is read beside it. model.ts is untouched and stays pure.

NOT IN THIS DIFF
  * src/lib/analytics.ts: T84 deletes the whole file (getLearnerSummary with it).
    It is the last user of SITTING_COLUMNS, so apply T84 before this.
  * getModuleForUser still reads learn_module_progress for lesson-level state
    (completed lessons, seconds, last lesson): that is not the Progress Record.
  * The volunteer portal Learn tab is retired, not ported. Indicative removal list in
    save7-os (from a grep, not exhaustive): src-vol/03-learn.js (whole file); in
    src-vol/03-app.js the Learn data load (the learn_levels, learn_modules,
    learn_lessons, learn_level_progress, learn_module_progress and
    vol_my_course_learning reads and VDB.learnLevel/learnModule/learner), levelDone,
    moduleDone, nextModule, the "next Learn step" nudges and the unapproved-volunteer
    status screen that links to the tab, the 'learn' entries in the tab lists and the
    default-tab rule, and the renderLearn() calls; then build-vol.mjs's 03-learn.js
    entry and any test that names them. The view vol_my_course_learning, and
    learn_my_stage_quizzes (nothing reads it after this), can be dropped later.

